    "summary": "Spend 1 CP in your [Movement phase](vsdata:core-rule/movement-phase) on 1 **ADEPTUS MECHANICUS** unit of yours. Choose 1 [Override ability](vsdata:ability/adeptus-mechanicus.haloscreed-battle-clade.noospheric-transference); it is active for that unit until your next [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) starts.\n\n- A **HALO OVERRIDE** unit first takes D3 **[mortal wounds](vsdata:core-rule/mortal-wounds)**, and can have this Override on top of other active ones.\n- A unit without **HALO OVERRIDE** has only the chosen Override and gains nothing from other active ones.",
